":null,"call_locator":"80ad2ceadba18d86548309e2ec22f83ac641fc10eb22362da34b5a265a28f9ec","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a34fecc50f4d7ab631e0f4006bedd2160d9087ef960d9a6435b1a10abb29a99","logical_entry_identity":"83dfe54ba064a9ae16b4a9ee1aff875bd2700e7caf45f3ac98bb4296eed726f4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"He eyes you and your belongings, then suddenly vanishes... strange, why is your pack lighter?","source_tag":"_t","target":"他盯着你和你的背包，然后突然消失不见……好奇怪，你的背包似乎轻了许多？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6bcea8c1af9c9f21f09fd0705006e9b0834d228847f427a87375ec393dca6a68","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a390e278f959362fc5f21bd4309d08756cf7384bd26f4ac85376b05b7c8a753","logical_entry_identity":"46d942ad209d0d4595ef036c911a33eead435d46e2ed4255c8d37f5de73c30b6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sixth time this week stuck guarding at the stash. And for what? Just a little fun! \n\nAlmost miss being at the farm sometimes. At least there I wasn't able to screw anything up. Wonder if they would take me back knowing what I've been doing with my life...","source_tag":"_t","target":"这已经是这周第六次呆在这里守卫了。我得到了什么？只得到了一点小乐子！\n\n好吧，我都开始怀念在农场里的日子了。至少那时候我不会把事情搞砸。真不知道如果他们知道我做了什么之后，是否还会把我带回去……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"facc413f5bc7da47f1f63b865dc6da68aee30edec9decdea43c47b669861d1ee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a45c819ebd34658b17a4bcfee10bbc6af2474a8586788c0a95d574827daf3da","logical_entry_identity":"4e84b7aa5f65bf4b2190136dac9db054996423647bc76fb823faca887bb6b37e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Crypt","source_tag":"_t","target":"地窖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"77bf4af1036a94621806a1320fc3e9d1f20d02b85774e252af31479cacdc3758","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a47de6fec2520a445ca671fcc28313b24c17183c857035e7d1a84ec6c27c10d","logical_entry_identity":"2599fccda81590764b1428a5e5da7d3846f864a271655143284be1d7a2cd4d3b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Crafted for a warlord who wanted to keep his subjects under a stralite grip. Dark thoughts went into the making of these gauntlets, literally.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位军阀为将臣民牢牢掌控于斯莱特之掌中而打造了这副手套。制作过程中确实注入了黑暗的思想。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef633d167f66618abb2ee79d3af23677c98a1dcfea1f7bccff02e8b8e403ada2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a4834a1fb415937bd794ed92cbd41e0d3d6fa8526e2a515d9958a759c23161f","logical_entry_identity":"936426f5d0d113cdf89a78954dfb729696f4b35b850b03f115534914f4b4671c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"huge maul","source_tag":"_t","target":"巨大的锤子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8b0d6caac0d28ae9235ee2846bd87206a956d22626d6f2b2e22271197ff571c7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a4a28f410641411aff968957c4ff2d6a3d3e28b69859e9880244e56e3405b0c","logical_entry_identity":"f4fc6224ec2c889a6bcb33b07a9e6d21dc61268ffa20189b86337dd36d030b7e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Vim#LAST#\nVim represents the amount of life energy you control. Each corruption talent requires some.\nIt does not regenerate naturally; you need to drain it from yourself or your victims.\nEach time you kill a creature you gain 30% of your Willpower + 1 as Vim.  This value is multiplied by half the rank of the creature.\nIf you can't pay for the Vim cost of a talent you may instead pay with life at a rate of 200% of the Vim cost.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#活力#LAST#\n活力是你控制的生命能量。施放堕落系法术需要消耗活力值。\n活力值不会自动回复，你需要从你自身和你的目标身上吸取。\n每杀死一个生物可以吸收意志属性30%+1的活力值。该数值乘以生物分级的一半。\n如果你无法支付使用一个技能的活力值，你可以改为支付活力值消耗200%的生命值。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"71616f891f6ef735e8d10873c690bb45a440c8cd9f51605e8bc7beb4b9e8d8e1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a4a495b5827d478f460902b947bb725d00adb1dd94dd724be1b6582bc5929ef","logical_entry_identity":"caba4dfa436d8016cc398a8653966486bfec8cf39eb64240e394f470b573d592","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Drolem","source_tag":"entity name","target":"卓勒姆"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"841